{"4975530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hyper Trigger", "steam_appid": 4975530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4975530/extras/a8c7f598b86fc1afd7ab2fe49dd43c74.avif?t=1787110914\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4975530/extras_big/a8c7f598b86fc1afd7ab2fe49dd43c74.webp?t=1787110914 width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper Trigger </strong>is a fast-paced rocket-jumping platformer set in a <strong>unique digital world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to HyperNet, Agent! { name: ######, id: 64, codename: &quot;typhoon&quot;, tool: &quot;anchor-12&quot; }</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your services as a <strong>cutting-edge security program </strong>have been requested after a number of <strong>hazardous viruses</strong> have been detected <strong>throughout cyberspace</strong>. Time is of the essence as you must <strong>dispatch threats</strong> and identify the <strong>root cause</strong> of the issue before a <strong>system-wide shutdown</strong> takes effect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your software has been determined as the <strong>most effective countermeasure</strong> to the ongoing situation, and you have been given <strong>level 9 admin</strong> <strong>permissions</strong>. <strong>Go get 'em Agent!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4975530/extras/132254d1017b2e1f1c26a333160d6d63.avif?t=1787110914\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4975530/extras_big/132254d1017b2e1f1c26a333160d6d63.webp?t=1787110914 width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the top of a <strong>virtual metropolis</strong> overrun by <strong>viruses</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of your <strong>revolving-rocket-shotgun </strong>to propel yourself through <strong>difficult platforming gauntlets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry momentum</strong> through the <strong>entire game</strong> in <strong>one graceful motion</strong> without loading screens or interruptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously switch between a number of <strong>stylish moves</strong> to build up your <strong>combo bar</strong> as you travel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each city district to the fullest while <strong>uncovering secrets</strong> and<strong> collecting cash.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt a number of <strong>bonus challenges</strong> like <strong>time trials</strong> and <strong>platforming puzzles</strong> to make even more bank. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against your <strong>friends' best times</strong> and <strong>climb the leaderboard</strong> to show your superiority.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to <strong>funky breakcore beats</strong> from a range of indie artists.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4975530/extras/6ecf5d8a579da40567edc65b2a6ef71a.poster.avif?t=1787110914\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4975530/extras/6ecf5d8a579da40567edc65b2a6ef71a.webm?t=1787110914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4975530/extras/6ecf5d8a579da40567edc65b2a6ef71a.mp4?t=1787110914\" type=\"video/